Acts 13:1 , Paul and Barnabas are chosen to go to the Gentiles;
Acts 13:6 , Of Sergius Paulus, and Elymas the sorcerer;
Acts 13:13 , Paul preaches at Antioch that Jesus is Christ;
Acts 13:42 , The Gentiles believe;
Acts 13:44 , but the Jews gainsay and blaspheme, whereupon they turn to the Gentiles, of whom many believe;
Acts 13:50 , The Jews raise a persecution against Paul and Barnabas, who go to Iconium.
